message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SCS-Quantum V0.4 — Frequency-Domain Wave-Packet Encoding with Tesseract Anchor"
abstract: >-
  SCS-Quantum is a frequency-domain wave-packet encoding framework using 13 bands
  and wave-packet dynamics. V0.4 integrates the Tesseract Anchor (Quantum Anchor V1.2)
  as the coherence preservation layer: 4 orthogonal planes × 5 phase realities = 20
  simultaneous pre-realities with self-annihilation via destructive interference.
  Evidence: ψ(37ns)=0.331662 (γ=0 model) on ibm_marrakesh 156Q Heron r2,
  Borg 16-node 100% clear (96.43% balance).
  Hardware-proven: 🔬 single-qubit dynamics and fractional-gate protocols.
